<title>SPAIN: Spanish Treasury to issue 10-yr ecu bond shortly.</title>
<headline>Spanish Treasury to issue 10-yr ecu bond shortly.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Treasury said on Tuesday its 10-year one billion ecu bond could be launched as soon as this week, an official told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We are working with banks, asking them to make offers and we could see the issue publicly announced this week,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The issue, announced in April, will be exchanged into euro and will be fungible with the domestic Treasury 10-year peseta bond, maturing on January 31 2008, with a six percent coupon, the source said.</p>
<p>This domestic issue was strippable.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
